  "Software Details": "Detalhes do software",
  "The Dash Saas Bookings Module makes managing your appointments simple and hassle-free. Our easy-to-use interface lets you set up and adjust booking slots quickly, ensuring your calendar is always up-to-date. Whether you are a solo business owner or managing a team, our scheduling tool adapts to your needs. From one-time meetings to recurring appointments, you’ll stay organized and in control with ease.": "O Módulo Dash Saas Bookings torna o gerenciamento de seus compromissos simples e descomplicado. ",
  "/Month": "/Mês",
  "/Year": "/Ano",
  "Buy Now": "Comprar agora",
  "View Live Demo": "Ver demonstração ao vivo",
  "Simplify Your Schedule with Dash SaaS Booking Module": "Simplifique sua programação com o módulo Dash SaaS Booking",
  "Streamline your scheduling with Dash SaaS Booking. Integrated seamlessly into the Dash Saas platform, our intuitive module minimizes conflicts and enhances customer satisfaction. Simplify appointments effortlessly.": "Simplifique seu agendamento com Dash SaaS Booking. ",
  "Great Customer Experience": "Ótima experiência do cliente",
  "Providing a great customer experience is simple with the Dash Saas Bookings Module. Clients can book appointments anytime through an easy online portal. Automatic confirmations and reminders help reduce no-shows, keeping everyone informed and prepared. The seamless integration with your website and social media allows clients to book services without leaving their favorite platforms, making the process smooth and convenient.": "Proporcionar uma ótima experiência ao cliente é simples com o Módulo Dash Saas Bookings. ",
  "Easy Integration and Customization": "Fácil integração e personalização",
  "Our Bookings Module works well with the tools you already use. Easily integrate with popular calendar apps like Google Calendar and Outlook to keep all your schedules in sync. Customize booking forms and workflows to fit your business needs. Whether you need to collect detailed information upfront or offer different service options, our module allows you to create a booking experience that matches your brand.": "Nosso Módulo de Reservas funciona bem com as ferramentas que você já utiliza. ",
  "Useful Analytics": "Análises úteis",
  "Get valuable insights into your booking trends and business performance with the Dash Saas Bookings Module/s analytics. Track important metrics like appointment numbers, peak booking times, and customer preferences. Use this data to make better decisions about staffing, marketing, and services. Our simple reports and dashboards give you a clear view of how your booking system is doing, helping you improve efficiency and profitability. Plus, you can manage bookings from both the backend and frontend, giving you complete control and flexibility over your scheduling process.": "Obtenha informações valiosas sobre suas tendências de reserva e desempenho de negócios com as análises do(s) módulo(s) de reservas Dash Saas. ",
  "Online Payments": "Pagamentos on-line",
  "With the Dash Saas Bookings Module, customers can pay for their appointments online quickly and securely. We support major payment gateways like Stripe and PayPal, making it easy for clients to complete transactions. This feature not only enhances convenience but also ensures that payments are processed efficiently, reducing the risk of missed payments and improving your cash flow. Offering online payment options helps streamline your business operations and provides a seamless experience for your customers.": "Com o Módulo Dash Saas Bookings, os clientes podem pagar por seus agendamentos online de forma rápida e segura. ",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "Por que escolher módulos dedicados",
  "for your business?": "para o seu negócio?",
